@host = http://localhost:5283

### Login (username hoặc email)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usernameOrEmail": "admin_bms", "password": "Admin@123" }

###
@access = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@refresh = {{login.response.body.refreshToken}}

### Thông tin user hiện tại
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Refresh (token cũ bị thu hồi, dùng lại sẽ huỷ cả phiên)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }

### Logout
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }

### Logout mọi thiết bị
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
